  nodes:
  - id: festOrga_start
    text: HELP! Kind stranger, please listen. In the span of the next days our island
      has to partake in an ancient tradition, but we lost the important pages that
      help us readout the forgotten language. Will you look for the pages when you
      leave this port? I promise I'll fix your boat a little bit.
